# The image only needs pyproject.toml + uv.lock + the entrypoint at build; the rest is bind-mounted.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!deploy/docker-entrypoint.sh
# The tor service's config (deploy/Dockerfile.tor COPYs it) — same shared build context.
!deploy/torrc
# The chrome service's entrypoint (deploy/Dockerfile.chrome COPYs it) — same shared context.
!deploy/chrome-entrypoint.sh
# …and the bearer-token proxy that entrypoint runs in front of CDP and noVNC. This file is
# an ALLOWLIST (`*` then exceptions), so a new COPY source that is not named here fails the
# build with "not found" on a file that is plainly present.
!deploy/browser-auth-proxy.py
